    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know what to do anymore. everything that could go wrong has gone wrong in the last month. i lost my job at the firm out of nowhere, then my bank account got flagged for \"suspicious activity\" and froze my funds, and now my passport is missing. it's like someone is trying to make sure i can't move or exist in the industry anymore. is it possible for all this to just be a coincidence? it feels too targeted.",
