      "content": "Those details you're sharing sound deeply unsettling and are certainly not things to dismiss as simple bad luck. Witnessing suspicious activity and feeling isolated by your neighbors elevates this situation beyond mere coincidence. Given these escalating concerns, prioritizing your safety and seeking external, objective help is crucial. I strongly advise consulting with a legal professional or a local consumer protection agency who can advise on the bank and job issues, while logging every interaction.",
